    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's exactly it. it's just... empty. i spent my whole life thinking if i could just get *there*, then everything would make sense. but now that i'm here, i realize i don't want much of anything. it feels like i've finished the game and there's no more content left. like there's nothing left to do. is it weird that i feel more relieved by that realization than i do by the actual success?",
