      "content": "maybe. but it feels less like finding myself and more like just... being done. i've checked every box. i've climbed every ladder. there's nothing left to strive for, no more goals to hit, no more versions of me to become. it's just like the mission is complete. i'm just wondering if there's any point in continuing to exist when there's no more progress left to make. it feels like i've reached the final credits.",
